<title>HONG KONG: PT Gajah Surya Finance sets US$40 mln loan.</title>
<headline>PT Gajah Surya Finance sets US$40 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan</p>
<p>issue was announced by arranger Sakura Merchant Bank</p>
<p>(Singapore).</p>
<p>BORROWER  PT GAJAH SURYA FINANCE</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$40 MLN SPLIT INTO TWO TRANCHES</p>
<p>	     TRANCHE A -- LENDERS ABSORB THE INDONESIAN</p>
<p>				WITHOLDING TAX ON INTEREST UP TO 10 PCT</p>
<p>	     TRANCHE B -- LENDERS ON A NON-WITHHOLDING TAX</p>
<p>				ABSORBED BASIS</p>
<p> TYPE	TERM LOAN  MARGIN  1,3,6MS+120BP  MATURITY  4 YRS</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 2	 CALLS    --		LAUNCH    04.APR.97</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN  --	   AVAIL    30 DAYS	 HOME CTRY INDONESIA</p>
<p> REPAYMENT BULLET     GOV LAW  SINGAPORE*</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   ARAB BANKING CORP SINGAPORE (BOOKS), N.V.</p>
<p>		 INDONESISCHE OVERSEESE BANK (BOOKS), SAKURA</p>
<p>		 MERCHANT BANK (SINGAPORE) (BOOKS) AND PT BANK</p>
<p>		 NEGARA INDONESIA (PERSERO) SINGAPORE.</p>
</text>
